<title>GERMANY: Kloeckner details results by division.</title>
<headline>Kloeckner details results by division.</headline>
<dateline>DUISBURG, Germany 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group incoming orders		    2,193   vs 2,226</p>
<p>	Of which, car parts			844   vs 1,152</p>
<p>	Plastic film				 554   vs   294</p>
<p>	Bottling and packaging		   612   vs   626</p>
<p>	Other					  183   vs   154</p>
<p>    Group sales				  2,059   vs 2,185</p>
<p>	Car parts				    915   vs 1,189</p>
<p>	Plastic film				 477   vs   268</p>
<p>	Bottling and packaging		   539   vs   585</p>
<p>	Other					  146   vs   159</p>
<p>    Domestic business			  1,089   vs 1,160</p>
<p>	Of which, exports			  515   vs   522</p>
<p>    Overseas business			    970   vs 1,025</p>
<p>    Workforce (March 31)		     16,599  vs 18,629</p>
<p>NOTE - German machinery maker Kloeckner Werke AG said earlier its group income from ordinary activities in the half was 16 million marks, compared with a four million mark loss in the year-earlier period.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-2609750</p>
</text>
